  "keyFeatures": [
    "Camera-based fingerprint capture and ORB feature extraction via OpenCV",
    "Two-pass hospital-wide patient identification (primary then non-primary fingerprints)",
    "GPS geofencing and WiFi SSID restriction to enforce hospital-premises-only access",
    "Role-based access control: super_admin, admin, doctor, nurse",
    "Fingerprint lock mechanism after repeated failed verification attempts",
    "GoT-HoMIS integration for EHR and insurance eligibility enrichment on match",
    "Patient demographic edit request workflow with admin approval queue",
    "Comprehensive audit logging of all authentication and fingerprint events",
    "Multi-hospital support with hospital-scoped data isolation"
  ],
